*SLCTR SELECT BEST RANKING ROW                                          IPM10416
       COUNT   147                                                      IPM10417
       ENTRY   SLCTR                                                    IPM10418
 SLCTR SXA     ST22,1                                                   IPM10419
       SXA     ST22+1,2                                                 IPM10420
       SXA     ST22+2,4                                                 IPM10421
